      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "这一周过得怎么样？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "比我想的忙，但是也学到了很多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "现在觉得最容易的是什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "每天的基本安排已经比较熟悉了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那最难的呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有时候事情一起来的时候，我还是会有点儿乱。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "这个很正常。你这周已经进步不少了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "特别是任务多的时候，我现在会先排顺序。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "还有遇到问题会先找原因。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，这两个方法真的很有用。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "下周你想重点练什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我想提高写消息和开会时表达的能力。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "很好。你可以每天记一个常用的表达。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "一个星期以后就有七个了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "对，而且都是你工作里真的会用到的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "这个方法我喜欢，比较实际。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "那下周继续，别给自己太大压力。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc010_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好。第一周顺利结束，值得庆祝一下。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
